    "detailed_description": "<strong>Approximately 90 minutes of core gameplay + additional replayable custom difficulties</strong><br><br>One Socket combines classic horror elements such as locked-in-place movement and limited resources with escape room mechanics to create a totally new and unique experience. Solve puzzles, avoid terrifying monsters, and uncover the secrets behind the mysterious experiment you have signed up for.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832130/extras/701f0e8f2f3f9a291019e89bf1303b81.poster.avif?t=1755270936\" width=601 height=339 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832130/extras/701f0e8f2f3f9a291019e89bf1303b81.webm?t=1755270936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Spooky environment, sound effects, and jumpscares<br></li><li>Narrative based playthrough with discoverable lore<br></li><li>Two unique escape rooms<br></li><li>8 randomized puzzles with difficulty levels Normal, Hard, and Extreme<br></li><li>5 environments<br></li><li>Retro style point and click<br></li><li>Unique visual style<br></li><li>Fixed in place movement<br></li><li>Custom difficulty mode where you can test your skills within the escape room</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Approximately 90 minutes of core gameplay + additional replayable custom difficulties</strong><br><br>One Socket combines classic horror elements such as locked-in-place movement and limited resources with escape room mechanics to create a totally new and unique experience. Solve puzzles, avoid terrifying monsters, and uncover the secrets behind the mysterious experiment you have signed up for.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832130/extras/701f0e8f2f3f9a291019e89bf1303b81.poster.avif?t=1755270936\" width=601 height=339 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832130/extras/701f0e8f2f3f9a291019e89bf1303b81.webm?t=1755270936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Spooky environment, sound effects, and jumpscares<br></li><li>Narrative based playthrough with discoverable lore<br></li><li>Two unique escape rooms<br></li><li>8 randomized puzzles with difficulty levels Normal, Hard, and Extreme<br></li><li>5 environments<br></li><li>Retro style point and click<br></li><li>Unique visual style<br></li><li>Fixed in place movement<br></li><li>Custom difficulty mode where you can test your skills within the escape room</li></ul>",
